OL,3,ARepublican congressman to force
OL,4,Aimpeachment vote on Defence Secretary
OL,5,AHegseth
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe effort will likely fail, given
OL,8,FRepublicans will remain in power in
OL,9,FCongress until January. But Massie says
OL,10,Fhe wants to push President Donald Trump
OL,11,Fto fire Hegseth before Democrats can
OL,12,Flaunch their own impeachment process.
OL,14,FHegseth, who will hold a news
OL,15,Fconference on Tuesday about Massie's
OL,16,Fmove, said he was not concerned.
